The search results indicate that for the most recent generation of the Vauxhall Insignia (2017-2022), the petrol engines were primarily 1.5-litre Turbo (140PS and 165PS) and a 2.0-litre Turbo (200PS and 230PS for GSi). One source mentions a 1.6-litre Turbo petrol with 200PS, which seems to have been added later in the range.

The designation 'i Turbo' is not consistently used in the provided sources for the most recent Insignia. The engines are referred to as "Turbo", "Turbo D", "CDTi", "BiTurbo", or simply by their displacement and power output (e.g., "1.5-litre Turbo petrol", "2.0-litre Turbo petrol").

